Infuse your weapon with the power of the Sun, adding [16, 35, 49, 61, 71 (TL1-5; SP 100)] light damage on each melee hit.

Additionally, if you have a temporary damage shield active, melee hits will increase its power by [16, 34, 48, 60, 71 (TL1-5; SP 100)] and set its duration to 2 (if not already higher), once per turn.

The damage dealt and shield bonus will increase with your Spellpower.
